          "page": "5",
          "section": "3.1. Metallographic Characterization",
          "quote": "The TZM grains are elongated along the rod axis (longitudinal) direction with high grain aspect ratios of approximately 10–15. Typical grain sizes along the longitudinal axis of specimens were up to 150–200 µm, whereas transverse dimensions were typically below 15–20 µm with smaller subgrains in the center of the rod.",
